# ============================================================
# Digital-ASIC-Design-Coursework — .gitignore
# Excludes regenerable EDA tool artifacts and licensed vendor data.
# ============================================================

# --- Vendor / licensed process data (NEVER commit) ---
# TSMC/Artisan standard-cell libraries are confidential and
# license-restricted. Keep a local copy outside git, or store
# a placeholder/README pointing to where to obtain them.
std_cells/
*.lib
*.db

# --- ModelSim / QuestaSim ---
work/
*.wlf
*.cr.mti
*.mpf
transcript
transcript*.txt
*.vstf
modelsim.ini

# --- Synopsys Design Compiler ---
*.svf
command.log
*_svf/
default.svf

# --- Synopsys Formality ---
*.lck
FM_WORK*/
formality*.log
formality*_svf/

# --- Synopsys generic logs/scratch ---
*.syn.log
syn.log
*.recent
*.sns
*.ss
*.dep
*.dmp
*.pbd/

# --- Cadence Encounter / Innovus ---
*.enc.dat/
.rikegr*
.interactive.constr.sdc
*.fp.spr
encounter.cmd
encounter.log

# --- Simulation waveforms / dumps (keep PDFs of key waveforms, drop raw dumps) ---
*.vcd

# --- OS / editor cruft ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*~
.$*.bkp
.fuse_hidden*

# --- Redundant submission archives ---
# If a folder is already unpacked in the repo, don't also keep
# the zip alongside it — pick one.
# (Not auto-ignored here since some zips ARE the actual deliverable;
#  review case-by-case before adding a rule like *_Mohamed_Hossam_El-Sawy.zip)
